{
  "id": "2CO.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Korinto 8",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, turashaka ko mumenya ubuntu Imana yagiriye amashengero y’i Makedoniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bageragejwe n’ivyago vyinshi kandi bafise ubworo bw’akaburarugero. Ariko bafise umunezero usagutse, wagaragariye mu gutanga kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndabishingira intahe ko batanze uko bashoboye, ndetse n’ibirengeye uko bashoboye. Kandi batanze bavyishakiye bo nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baratwinginze kenshi ngo tubagirire ubuntu ngo bagire ico bakoze mu gutanga imfashanyo igenewe abera b’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakoze ibirengeye ivyo twari twiteze, kanatsinda babanje kwitanga ubwabo, biha Umwami bongera baratwiha nk’uko Imana yabigomvye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma twinginze Tito, uwabateye intege zo gutanga mu ntango, ngo agaruke abandanye ico gikorwa c’ubuntu akirangize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nk’uko muri agakura mu kwizera, mu mvugo, mu bumenyi, mu mwete mwinshi no mu rukundo mudufitiye, mube agakura muri ubwo buntu bwo gutanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibi sindabibabwira nk’itegeko, ariko nshaka kumenya ko urukundo rwanyu atari uruheyiheyi tugereranije n’umwete ayandi mashengero afise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko muzi ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, ko n’aho yari umutunzi wa vyose, yigize umukene ku bwanyu kugira ngo mu bukene bwiwe mube abatunzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi ni yo nama yanje y’uko bikwiye kugenda: mu mwaka uheze mwabaye ab’imbere mu gushaka gutanga, ndetse muba n’ab’imbere mu kubikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero nimurangize ico gikorwa mwatanguye, kugira ngo rirya shaka mwerekanye mu ntango ribonekere mu kubishira mu ngiro. Mutange bivanye n’uko mushoboye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko iyo umuntu atanga n’umutima ubikunze, ico atanze cemerwa n’Imana uko nyene, ntimutegeka gutanga ico adafise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico twipfuza si uko bamwe boroherwa n’ubuzima namwe musigaye mu bukene, ariko ni uko mwogira ibingana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubu mufise umusesekara, kandi murashoboye gufasha abakenye. Ikindi gihe kizoza aho na bo bazoba bafise umusesekara, bakabafasha mukenye. Aho ni ho hazoba hari ukungana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga: “Abegeranije vyinshi basanze bitarenze ivyo bakeneye, abegeranije bike na bo basanze bitari musi y’ivyo bari bakeneye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kuvayo 16:18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndashima Imana yashize mu mutima wa Tito umwitwarariko nk’uwanje ku bwanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko yakiranye umutima mwiza ugutera intege kwacu, kandi akaba afise inyota yo kugaruka iwanyu avyishakiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumurungikanye n’uwundi mwene Data ashimwa n’amashengero yose ku bw’ibikorwa vyiwe vy’Ubutumwa Bwiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ishengero ni ryo ryamugenye ngo aduherekeze dutwaye imfashanyo i Yerusalemu, ico ni igikorwa c’ubuntu gihesha Imana icubahiro, kikerekana umwete dufise mu gufasha abatishoboye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dushaka ko ata wodutora utunenge mu buryo dutanga izo mfashanyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko twipfuza kubikora neza mu bwizigirwa, atari imbere y’Imana, ariko no mu maso y’abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tubarungikanye kandi n’uwundi mwene Data twabonyemwo ishaka muri vyinshi. Noneho iryo shaka ryabaye ryinshi ku bw’ivyizigiro afise muri mwebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo Tito we, ni umugenzi dufatanije igikorwa muri mwebwe; abo bandi bene Data na bo, ni intumwa z’amashengero, kandi bubaha Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero nimubereke, imbere y’amashengero, icemeza ko urukundo mubafitiye ari urw’ukuri kandi ko dufise imvo ituma tubanezerererwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
